&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are open to remote candidates located within PST to BRT time zones.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Metalab, we partner with companies ready to change the world—helping them create products that improve lives, reshape markets, and shift culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Design Director, you’ll play a pivotal role in shaping the quality of our work and nurturing the talent of our design team. You will lead with vision, balancing execution with mentorship to ensure teams deliver outstanding, high-impact design solutions. You’ll collaborate closely with cross-functional partners, driving both business and user value while setting a clear standard for design excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You thrive in ambiguity, bring strategic thinking to complex challenges, and elevate the work through deep expertise in product design, brand, and storytelling. As a leader, you’ll advocate for high-quality, user-centred design and ensure that Metalab remains at the forefront of digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead by Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance leadership with hands-on design execution, working alongside teams to create and ship exceptional work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply deep expertise in product design, design systems, product strategy, and human-centred design to guide and refine work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively contribute to raising the bar for design excellence, providing clear and actionable feedback to project teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement &amp;amp; Delivery Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted design advisor to clients, guiding them through the design process, presenting work, managing feedback, and building strong relationships grounded in Metalab’s point of view on design direction and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive strategic project success by applying service design and change management principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Business Development team to scope work and identify strategic business development opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advocacy &amp;amp; Leadership at Metalab&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a collaborative, inclusive, and high-performance design culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Metalab leadership to drive engagement and maintain a strong company culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, mentor, and develop design team members, ensuring a strong pipeline of leadership within the design team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Metalab in the design community, attracting top talent and new business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UX Design: You define UX quality standards, push teams toward innovation, and drive best practices across research, strategy, and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visual Design: You champion high-quality visual execution and stay current on trends, emerging technologies, and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Strategy: You ensure design work aligns with overarching product roadmaps, release strategies, and market positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critique &amp;amp; Collaboration: You guide teams in fostering a culture of constructive critique, both internally and with clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research: You leverage qualitative and quantitative data to inform and validate design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Content Design: You advocate for clear, compelling communication that aligns with brand strategy and user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Selling Design: You craft compelling narratives that help clients understand and buy into design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vision: You lead teams in developing experience concepts, balancing business goals, user needs, and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative Direction: You ensure the strategic and creative impact of all projects, guiding teams through execution and client presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems Design: You define scalable design systems that ensure usability, adoption, and long-term maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brand Strategy: You confidently lead brand workshops and strategy sessions, guiding clients toward compelling creative directions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing and mentoring design teams through complex challenges while maintaining high-quality output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills, with the ability to align and influence diverse stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with cross-functional teams to drive business priorities and deliver tangible value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active engagement in the design community, sharing insights through articles, panels, and thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for inclusive design practices and fostering a collaborative team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of change management and service design principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinking, with the ability to contribute to business development and client relationship-building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Research shows that women and other marginalized groups tend to only apply for a job when they meet every single criteria. Does this role sound like it was made for you, yet you don’t check every box? Reach out anyways!&amp;nbsp; We’re an equal opportunity employer and are dedicated to fostering an inclusive and diverse environment for employees from all walks of life.&amp;nbsp; We hire based on talent, and we’re proud of our global perspective.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;About &lt;a href=&quot;http://Customer.io&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over 8,000 companies — from scrappy startups to global brands — use our platform to send billions of emails, push notifications, in-app messages, and SMS every day. &lt;a href=&quot;http://Customer.io&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt; powers automated communication that people actually want to receive. We help teams send smarter, more relevant messages using real-time behavioral data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hi, I’m Matt Lane, Sr. Manager of Account Management at &lt;a href=&quot;http://Customer.io&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt;, and I’m hiring a Sr. Account Manager to join our EMEA team. &lt;strong&gt;This is a sales role.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll own a portfolio of mid-market and enterprise customers and be accountable for generating expansion pipeline, closing new revenue, and securing renewals.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll build on existing customer relationships and prospect beyond them. That means cold calling people who haven’t worked with us, identifying new buying teams, and winning business with additional brands within the same parent company. You’ll lead discovery, build relationships with multiple stakeholders, and own each deal from the first conversation through negotiation and close.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re looking for someone with &lt;strong&gt;a track record in B2B sales&lt;/strong&gt; who can walk us through an expansion deal they sourced and closed. You should be comfortable generating your own pipeline, multi-threading across complex accounts, and using a sales methodology such as MEDDICC to qualify opportunities and move deals forward.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is open to candidates based in the UK or Ireland only.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we value&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial ownership — you treat your book of business like it&#39;s yours, because it is&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecasting discipline and data-driven decision-making, not gut feel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-threaded relationships — you build trust across the org, not just with one champion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expansion through value, not feature gates or mechanical levers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close partnership with Customer Success — you see CS as a collaborator, not a handoff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full commercial strategy for a portfolio of mid-market and enterprise accounts — renewals, expansion, and churn mitigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive growth by helping customers adopt &lt;a href=&quot;http://Customer.io&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt; more strategically, identifying new use cases and articulating ROI clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast renewal and expansion pipeline accurately with a clear, repeatable methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build multi-threaded relationships from day-to-day operators to Directors and VPs, becoming a trusted commercial advisor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Customer Success on account health and with Sales on expansion deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage Legal and Finance on complex renewals and collaborate cross-functionally to move deals forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in Sr. Account Management, Sales, or a related SaaS commercial role with direct ownership of a revenue number (5+ years preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing $5m ARR, predominantly in the MM space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to grow customer spend outside of overages or true-ups — genuine expansion through adoption and value articulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A forecasting methodology you can walk through clearly — it doesn&#39;t need to be a named framework, just logic you own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable pulling usage data, tracking health scores, and building your own dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator — clear and persuasive with both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in the UK or Ireland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in transparency. Starting salary for this role is $142,900 - $171,000 OTE USD (or equivalent in your local currency) depending on experience and subject to market rate adjustment. This role is a 70/30 OTE split.&amp;nbsp;In addition to base salary, this role includes an equity grant in the form of stock options, so you share in the success you help build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We know our people are what make us great, and we&#39;re committed to taking great care of them. Our inclusive benefits package supports your well-being and growth, including &lt;strong&gt;100% coverage of medical, dental, vision, mental health, and supplemental insurance premiums for you and your family&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer &lt;strong&gt;16 weeks paid parental leave, unlimited PTO&lt;/strong&gt;, stipends for remote work and wellness, a professional development budget, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://customer.io/careers#:~:text=our%20collective%20success.-,BENEFITS,-Our%C2%A0&quot;&gt;See full benefits here →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No gotchas, no trick questions - just a clear, human process designed to help both of us make an informed decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute video call with a Recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;45-minute video call with the Hiring Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take-Home Assignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-hour Assignment Review Call with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All final candidates will be asked to complete a background check and employment verifications as part of our pre-employment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Join us!&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://customer.io/careers/&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt; for more information about why you should &lt;a href=&quot;https://customer.io/about/&quot;&gt;come work with us!&lt;/a&gt; We believe in empathy, transparency, responsibility, and, yes, a little awkwardness. If you&#39;re excited by what you read — apply now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/bG5qLRPW-RY?si=jcbogHq_VcQHjgS8&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;315&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

