&lt;h4&gt;Why CAST AI?&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CAST AI is the leading Kubernetes automation platform for AWS, GCP and Azure customers. The company is on a mission to deliver a fully automated Kubernetes experience. What’s unique about CAST AI is that its platform goes beyond monitoring clusters and making recommendations; it utilizes advanced machine learning algorithms to analyze and automatically optimize clusters, saving customers 50% or more on their cloud spend, improving performance and reliability, and boosting DevOps and engineering productivity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The company has raised $73M from investors, including Cota Capital, Creandum, Uncorrelated Ventures, and Vintage Investment Partners. CAST AI has nearly 200 employees globally and is headquartered in Miami, Florida.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;However, this is merely the beginning. Our product roadmap is filled with exciting innovations that are yet to come. We are searching for intelligent, motivated, and self-reliant people to help us fulfill this ambitious mission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Core values that hold us all together:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DEVELOP AND HIRE THE BEST:&lt;/strong&gt; Be curious and improve continuously to foster personal development and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LEAD:&lt;/strong&gt; Take ownership, never kick the can, and drive things forward in a full-power mode. The company is in your hands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EXPECT AND ADVOCATE CHANGE:&lt;/strong&gt; Constantly welcome new ideas and opinions. Share insights responsibly with unwavering openness, honesty, and respect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PRACTICE CUSTOMER OBSESSION:&lt;/strong&gt; The customer always, always, always comes first. Solve the customer’s problem, be open to feedback, act on it, and the rest will follow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;A Glimpse into the Customer Success Team&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our customer-obsessed technical account management team is dedicated to delivering world-class assistance to our clients. They are the bridge between our customers and the wider CAST AI organization, representing the customer&#39;s voice to CAST AI and the voice of CAST AI to the customer. The team ensures that our customers are successful in their use of our platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Role overview&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; The technical account manager is the technical leader and trusted advisor for their assigned customers. Your customers should not hesitate to reach out to you as the first point of escalation, and you are responsible for orchestrating resources to achieve our team’s shared goal of customer delight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Customer Onboarding:&lt;/strong&gt; You will lead the technical onboarding process for new customers, ensuring that all their clusters are connected to CAST AI in 90 days. This is a highly technical role; you will work closely with DevOps engineers and SREs. We are looking for candidates with a strong technical background who can easily convey complex technical concepts to a variety of audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Renewals:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and drive the renewal process to closure in partnership with the account team. We believe that a successful renewal is a natural outcome of delivering continuous proactive value through regular check-ins.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FinOps Business Reviews&lt;/strong&gt;: You are responsible for continuously showcasing the value of CAST AI through monthly and quarterly business reviews. You will lead these discussions (remote and in-person) and highlight cost savings, automation,&amp;nbsp;upcoming innovation and new products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Up-skilling:&lt;/strong&gt; We take great pride in continuously improving our technical skills. All technical account managers at CAST AI are either CKAD/CKA holders. If you do not have a CKAD certification, it is mandatory to achieve the certification&amp;nbsp;within 6 months of joining, sponsored by us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Requirements&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field. Foundational knowledge is crucial for understanding the complex technical aspects of our product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 5 years of professional experience in cloud computing, focusing on major platforms like AWS, Azure, or GCP. Additionally, experience in container orchestration with Kubernetes is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and technical acumen. It would help you navigate complex technical environments and develop solutions that align with client needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, both written and verbal. You must be able to articulate technical concepts clearly and understandably to various audiences, including those who may need a technical background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CKAD and/or CKA certification(s) is an immense advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What&#39;s in&amp;nbsp;it for you?&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a fast-growing, cutting-edge company that’s redefining cloud-native automation and optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a global team of cloud experts and innovators, passionate about pushing the boundaries of &lt;em&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/em&gt; technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a flexible, remote-first work environment with opportunities to travel and engage with customers worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive a competitive compensation package, equity options, and extensive benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why CAST AI?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cast AI is an automation platform that operates cloud-native and AI infrastructure at scale. By embedding autonomous decision-making directly into Kubernetes and cloud environments, Cast AI continuously optimizes performance, reliability, and efficiency in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The old way doesn&#39;t work. As Kubernetes and AI environments grow, manual decisions don’t. Cast AI replaces tickets, alerts, and manual tuning with continuous automation that adapts infrastructure as conditions change. Efficiency and cost savings follow naturally from that automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over 2,100 companies already rely on Cast AI, including Akamai, BMW, Cisco, FICO, HuggingFace, NielsenIQ, Swisscom, and TGS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Global team, diverse perspectives&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re headquartered in Miami, but our impact is international. We take a global and intentional approach to diversity. Today, Cast AI operates across 34 countries spanning Europe, North America, Latin America, and APAC, bringing a wide range of perspectives into how we build and lead.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unicorn momentum&lt;br&gt;In January 2026, we achieved unicorn status with a strategic investment from Pacific Alliance Ventures, the corporate venture arm of Shinsegae Group (a $50+ billion Korean conglomerate). Our valuation now exceeds $1 billion, and we&#39;re just getting started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us as we build the future of autonomous infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Client Partners work closely with our existing customers to build long-lasting customer relationships and ensure increased adoption, quick value realization and long-term delight for each customer&#39;s journey. Account Managers will also be tasked with upselling and cross-selling our existing and new solutions to their managed accounts and will be compensated accordingly based on these results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Global Client Partner at CAST AI, you’ll own 2-3 of our largest enterprise relationships worldwide. Your job is to grow each one into a multi-million dollar ARR account. This is a hunter role. You’re expected to go find new budget, new teams, and new use cases inside each account, and then close them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You own the commercial side end to end, including negotiating and closing the contracts. Our TAMs handle the technical side, so you can stay focused on the relationship and the deal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This fits someone who has built and grown large enterprise accounts at companies like Cisco, Accenture, Deloitte, or Samsung. You know how to get into a big org, build a network across it, and turn those relationships into bigger deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and run a multi-year plan for each account, and drive new business, upsell, and cross-sell across business units and regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contracts and Commercials:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the contractual agreement with each customer, including negotiation, pricing, closing, and renewals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain relationships at the VP and C-level, and a wide network across each customer’s org.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value and Account Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Make sure each customer sees the savings and impact from CAST AI, and tie that to expansion and renewals. Track usage and risk so nothing surprises you at renewal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnership with TAMs and R&amp;amp;D:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with your TAM on technical needs and with R&amp;amp;D on product feedback and roadmap questions for your accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of enterprise account management or sales, with a proven record of growing strategic accounts into multi-million dollar relationships&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of building executive relationships and networks inside large enterprises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success negotiating and closing large, complex enterprise contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify key contacts, understand client needs, and tailor proposals to address those needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kubernetes, sales lifecycle, and Cloud space is a significant plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a fast-growing, cutting-edge company that’s redefining cloud-native automation and optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a global team of cloud experts and innovators, passionate about pushing the boundaries of Kubernetes technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a flexible, remote-first work environment with opportunities to travel and engage with customers worldwide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package, equity options, and extensive benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kimchi is Cast AI&#39;s newest product: an agentic platform for running AI workloads. We are building in a greenfield space where the technology, customer expectations, and the competitive landscape shift constantly. The problem space is broad and ambiguous by design. If you are at your best when the playbook is still being written, you will thrive here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a role for maintaining a mature product line. It&#39;s a hands-on, zero-to-one PMM job inside a startup-like team with the backing of a unicorn. You must be curious. You&#39;ll speak directly with early customers, run messaging and channel experiments, and work with your Sr. PMM team mate to build Kimchi&#39;s GTM from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll report to the Head of Product Marketing, and work alongside Product, Engineering, and company leadership, with support from Content, Growth, Design, and Sales Enablement as the work scales. You&#39;ll have room to identify quick wins on your own, with a review partner to help you balance short-term execution with a longer-term roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Why Cast AI?&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cast AI is an automation platform that operates cloud-native and AI infrastructure at scale. By embedding autonomous decision-making directly into Kubernetes and cloud environments, Cast AI continuously optimizes performance, reliability, and efficiency in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The old way doesn&#39;t work. As Kubernetes and AI environments grow, manual decisions don’t. Cast AI replaces tickets, alerts, and manual tuning with continuous automation that adapts infrastructure as conditions change. Efficiency and cost savings follow naturally from that automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over 2,100 companies already rely on Cast AI, including Akamai, BMW, Cisco, FICO, HuggingFace, NielsenIQ, Swisscom, and TGS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global team, diverse perspectives&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We&#39;re headquartered in Miami, but our impact is international. We take a global and intentional approach to diversity. Today, Cast AI operates across 34 countries spanning Europe, North America, Latin America, and APAC, bringing a wide range of perspectives into how we build and lead.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unicorn momentum&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;In January 2026, we achieved unicorn status with a strategic investment from Pacific Alliance Ventures, the corporate venture arm of Shinsegae Group (a $50+ billion Korean conglomerate). Our valuation now exceeds $1 billion, and we&#39;re just getting started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What success looks like in 90 days&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand Kimchi&#39;s product, the problems it solves, and its priority audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You scope the highest-priority PMM problems instead of trying to solve everything at once, with guidance on where to focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You run small experiments that produce trackable wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take ownership of your workstreams: you bring clear recommendations and trade-offs, and you know when to decide and when to escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build working relationships with Product and Engineering, and learn the product deeply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Requirements:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of product marketing experience with technical audiences, preferably developer tools or AI tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency. You can grasp nuances without an engineer walking you through every detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, sprint-based working style with an experimental mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to ICP definition and messaging work, ideally for an early-stage or unvalidated product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience conducting customer interviews and extracting patterns that refine positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or running GTM experiments, and the willingness to change direction based on what the data shows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data literacy: you can define success criteria and read funnel or adoption data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound commercial judgment on pricing, packaging, and willingness to pay, even when Product owns the final call.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English, written and spoken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have thrived in an early-stage or ambiguous product environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What would make you stand out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can point to a PMM outcome that AI meaningfully improved, whether in speed, quality, reuse, or measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent writing, backed by work samples such as positioning docs, launch content, and sales narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with agentic AI tools or developer-facing products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Responsibilities&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run customer research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive positioning and messaging day to day, and keep it consistent as new features ship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the commercial hypothesis - audience, message, positioning - and design GTM tests across trial flow, content, and channels. Growth, Product, and Demand Gen will help execute the experiments and measure results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate Kimchi&#39;s technical differentiation into a value story that technical buyers recognize as true.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support feature launches end to end, from early positioning through GA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build sales enablement assets, battlecards, proof points, and demo narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the feedback loop from customer and market signal back into roadmap input.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track the competitive landscape and share what is changing with Product and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with Engineering to keep messaging accurate as the product evolves quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain AI-assisted workflows that make this function faster, more consistent, or easier to measure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary (depending on the level of experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a flexible, remote-first global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a global team of cloud experts and innovators, passionate about pushing the boundaries of what’s possible in AI.&lt;/li&gt;
