&lt;h4&gt;Why Cast AI?&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cast AI is the leading Kubernetes automation platform for cloud-native and AI infrastructure. Instead of raising alerts for someone else to fix, it acts directly in production. It scales and rightsizes workloads, live-migrates eligible workloads, and sources GPU capacity across clouds and regions through OMNI. Every optimization is verified and logged, so customers see lower costs, stronger performance and reliability, and less manual toil.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over 2,100 companies rely on Cast AI, including Akamai, BMW, Cisco, FICO, HuggingFace and Swisscom.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global team, diverse perspectives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re headquartered in Miami, but our impact is international. We take a global and intentional approach to diversity, with a team across 35 countries in Europe, the Americas and APAC, including our newest market, Australia, bringing a wide range of perspectives into how we build and lead.&lt;/p&gt;
