&lt;p&gt;In January 2026, we reached unicorn status with a strategic investment from Pacific Alliance Ventures, the venture arm of Korea’s Shinsegae Group. Our valuation now exceeds $1 billion, and we’re just getting started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us as we build Kubernetes automation that engineering teams can verify and trust.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About the role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a ground-floor build, not a maintenance job. The foundation is real - a defined partner tiering model, a growing partner base, and Partner Managers already running the MSP and VAR tiers day-to-day. What&#39;s missing is the person who turns that into a forecastable revenue engine: recruiting and activating the partners that actually move the needle across regional and boutique SIs, resellers, VARs, distributors, and MSPs, managing and growing the PAM team, and being the person sales leadership turns to for how the channel is performing and where it&#39;s headed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Cast AI scales past unicorn status, this is a genuine build-and-own mandate for the Americas channel, not an inherited process to maintain.&lt;/p&gt;
