&lt;li&gt;Proven track record building or scaling a multi-tier partner programme (MSP, VAR, regional SI, or similar) at a high-growth SaaS or cloud infrastructure company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience managing a team of PAMs or channel reps - hiring, coaching, and performance-managing multiple direct reports, with the judgment to know when to let them run and when to get involved&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence - able to represent Cast AI credibly with partner stakeholders and with internal sales leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable selling to and through DevOps, Platform Engineering, and FinOps personas; working familiarity with AWS, GCP, and Azure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with the mechanics of a channel programme: deal registration, joint account planning, QBRs, co-sell motions, partner incentives&lt;/li&gt;
