&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ecb5228c9805&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Design, build, and operate the CI/CD pipelines every engineering team ships through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;e44b2a6d1c30&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Build and maintain the observability and monitoring tooling other teams use to debug their own systems in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;fb5c2290bc6c&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Build local development environment tooling that lets engineers reproduce production-like conditions on their laptop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;12d2505d26d0&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Reduce friction for every other team: identify where engineers lose time to infrastructure and fix it at the root, not with a workaround.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;393c61b43046&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Debug complex issues that span CI/CD, observability tooling, Kubernetes, and cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
