&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be solving&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;cdaed0451f8d&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;A platform engineer opens their AI client of choice, connects it to CAST AI, and types: &lt;em data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;em&quot;&gt;&quot;Why did our spend jump 40% in eu-west last week?&quot;&lt;/em&gt; Thirty seconds later they have an answer, pulled from live cluster state and cost data, with links back to the evidence. No dashboards. No YAML archaeology. Just a question and a correct, permission-checked answer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;b8494f479046&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your job is to make that interaction boring. Reliably, securely, at production scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;50f8133f28bf&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Behind it sits the hard part: an AI assistant that reasons over thousands of production Kubernetes clusters, a platform that safely exposes company infrastructure to external AI clients, and quality pipelines that tell us when the agent is wrong before a customer does. Get it right, and operators stop clicking through consoles entirely. Get it wrong once, and an agent gives a confidently wrong answer to someone managing production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;8e942e75a139&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;CAST AI already runs Kubernetes infrastructure autonomously. Our automation makes thousands of cost-and-reliability decisions a day. Cast Pilot is the team building the intelligence layer on top of that: &lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;AI assistants for Kubernetes and the cloud itself&lt;/strong&gt;. Our assistant already answers thousands of questions a month from hundreds of organizations. Now we&#39;re opening the platform up: a public, permission-aware MCP server so customers can plug CAST AI straight into their own AI clients and agents, deeper connectivity across all three major clouds (AWS, GCP, Azure), and a continuous push to make our agents smarter, better grounded, and more capable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;a1e0ed738677&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;This is greenfield AI platform work on top of battle-tested infrastructure. Most features ship in 1 to 4 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;b569d0157071&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;This is a location-specific opportunity. We are currently accepting applications from candidates residing in the following European countries: Bulgaria, Croatia, Estonia, Greece, Hungary, Latvia, Lithuania, Poland, Romania, Slovakia, Cyprus, Malta, Finland, Sweden, Ireland, Moldova, North Macedonia, Montenegro, Slovenia, and Ukraine.&lt;/p&gt;
